  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the grill to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. In a bowl, mix together vibrant spice blend, cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper (if using), and salt.",
    "3. Add the crumbled comte cheese to the spice mixture and mix until well combined.",
    "4. Brush the tacos with oil and grill until crispy.",
    "5. Grill the onions, ginger, and tomato until tender.",
    "6. Add the grilled onions, ginger, and tomato to the cheese mixture and mix until well combined.",
    "7. Spoon the cheese mixture onto the tacos.",
    "8. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
